---
import PersonalLayout from "../layouts/PersonalLayout.astro";
import GenericImage from "../components/GenericImage.astro";
---

<PersonalLayout title="Sombras" subtitle="Dark fantasy novel">
    <section class="about-section text-light py-5">
        <div class="container">
            <h1 class="display-4 text-center mb-4">Sombras</h1>
            <p class="lead text-justify">
                Sombras is a dark fantasy novel that I am currently writing.
                Where mutants called shadows have goals that will complete no
                matter what. The story is set in a world where good intentions
                crumble, where the characters are faced with moral dilemmas and
                difficult choices.
            </p>
            <div class="text-center mb-4">
                <GenericImage
                    project="sombras"
                    alt="Sombras Novel Cover"
                    />
                <p>
                    <b>"Sombras"</b> invites you into a world of mystery, magic,
                    and untold secrets. Step into an intricate fantasy realm where
                    diverse races, arcane forces, and hidden truths shape the fate
                    of those who dare to seek them.

                    <p>
                        Follow Yhtia and Avdey as they navigate a perilous
                        journey, uncovering dark conspiracies and confronting
                        forces beyond their understanding. With rich, immersive
                        storytelling and vivid world-building, this tale will
                        transport you to distant lands, making you feel every
                        triumph and tragedy along the way.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Loyalty, sacrifice, and redemption intertwine in a
                        narrative that will keep you captivated until the very
                        last page. Are you ready to step into the shadows and
                        uncover what lies within?"
                    </p>
                </p>
            </div>
            <p class="text-justify small mt-5">
                The novel is still in its early stages, but I am excited about
                the direction it is taking. I hope to share more about it as I
                continue to write.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>
</PersonalLayout>
